[00:24.22]Jehovah knows just what we need
[00:29.62]To bring us joy and to succeed.
[00:36.46]So he provides so many ways
[00:42.64]In which to serve and spend our days.
[00:49.78](Chorus)
[00:49.93]Reaching out, giving all,
[00:50.43]for our God above.
[00:50.83]And where the need is great, there we’ll be,
[00:51.78]reaching out in love.
[00:52.28]There’s work to do in ev’ry land.
[00:52.97]Where there’s a need, we lend a hand.
[00:53.75]By reaching out, we show we care.
[00:54.47]We want to help and want to share.
[00:55.07](Chorus)
[00:55.22]Reaching out, giving all,
[00:55.80]for our God above.
[01:01.26]And where the need is great, there we’ll be,
